# Model pickles are tracked under src/coastline/sdk/predictors/performance/data_driven/portfolio/,
# the large ones through Git LFS (.gitattributes).
# portfolio/custom/ holds models tuned locally with `coastline utils tune` (it creates the folder).
# The resolver tries custom/ first, so a committed file there would replace the bundled model.
src/coastline/sdk/predictors/performance/data_driven/portfolio/custom/
